---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = "Best Mic Under 2000 for YouTube in India (2026) - Tested Picks";
const desc = "5 best mics under Rs 2000 for YouTube, Reels in India: Boya BY-M1, K8 wireless, Fifine K669B. Real prices, noisy room advice.";
---
<Layout title={title} desc={desc}>
<main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 pb-10">
<div class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-4">Affiliate disclosure: links may earn us commission at no extra cost to you.</div>
<div class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">By Noyel G • Updated 6 Sept 2026 • Tested in 12x10ft room, fan on</div>
<h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold mt-1 leading-tight">Best Mic Under 2000 for YouTube India</h1>
<p class="text-gray-600 mt-1">Bad audio = no views. These 5 survive fan + traffic noise. Prices Amazon.in Sept 2026.</p>

<div class="bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-5 mt-4 grid gap-3">
<div class="flex justify-between items-center bg-white/10 rounded-xl p-3">
<div><div class="text-xs opacity-70">🏆 OVERALL WINNER</div><div class="font-bold">Boya BY-M1 • Rs 999</div><div class="text-xs opacity-70">Wired, no battery, phone + PC</div></div>
<a href="#" class="bg-yellow-400 text-black text-sm font-bold px-4 py-2 rounded-full whitespace-nowrap">Price →</a>
</div>
<div class="flex justify-between items-center bg-white/10 rounded-xl p-3">
<div><div class="text-xs opacity-70">📱 REELS WINNER</div><div class="font-bold">K8 Wireless • Rs 1499</div><div class="text-xs opacity-70">10hr battery, Type-C + iPhone</div></div>
<a href="#" class="bg-yellow-400 text-black text-sm font-bold px-4 py-2 rounded-full whitespace-nowrap">Price →</a>
</div>
</div>

<div class="space-y-3 mt-4">
<div class="bg-white border shadow-sm rounded-2xl p-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="bg-indigo-600 text-white text-xs font-bold w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full">1</span><div class="font-bold">Boya BY-M1 - Rs 999</div><span class="text-xs bg-green-100 text-green-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-bold ml-auto">Best overall</span></div><div class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">6m cable, clear voice, needs Open Camera app on Xiaomi/Realme sometimes. No charging ever.</div><a href="#" class="inline-block bg-yellow-400 font-bold px-4 py-2 rounded-full mt-2 text-sm">Check price on Amazon →</a></div>
<div class="bg-white border shadow-sm rounded-2xl p-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="bg-indigo-600 text-white text-xs font-bold w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full">2</span><div class="font-bold">K8 Wireless - Rs 1499</div><span class="text-xs bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-bold ml-auto">Reels</span></div><div class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Plug-play, 20m range, noise cut for street. Enable OTG on phone.</div><a href="#" class="inline-block bg-yellow-400 font-bold px-4 py-2 rounded-full mt-2 text-sm">Check price →</a></div>
<div class="bg-white border shadow-sm rounded-2xl p-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="bg-gray-400 text-white text-xs font-bold w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full">3</span><div class="font-bold">Fifine K669B USB - Rs 2549</div></div><div class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Only if PC videos. Cardioid rejects fan noise. Stretch budget but worth for desk.</div><a href="#" class="inline-block bg-gray-200 font-bold px-4 py-2 rounded-full mt-2 text-sm">Check price →</a></div>
<div class="bg-white border shadow-sm rounded-2xl p-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="bg-gray-400 text-white text-xs font-bold w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full">4</span><div class="font-bold">Humble HB-C01 Type-C - Rs 699</div></div><div class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Cheapest Type-C wired. No battery. Good backup second mic.</div><a href="#" class="inline-block bg-gray-200 font-bold px-4 py-2 rounded-full mt-2 text-sm">Check price →</a></div>
<div class="bg-white border shadow-sm rounded-2xl p-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="bg-gray-400 text-white text-xs font-bold w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full">5</span><div class="font-bold">Grenaro Dual - Rs 1999</div></div><div class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">2 mics, 50m range, reverb mode. For 2-person interviews.</div><a href="#" class="inline-block bg-gray-200 font-bold px-4 py-2 rounded-full mt-2 text-sm">Check price →</a></div>
</div>

<div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-2xl p-4 mt-5">
<h2 class="font-extrabold">Noisy room? Read this</h2>
<p class="text-sm leading-6 mt-1">Fan + traffic = keep mic 15cm from mouth. Wired lapel beats USB condenser in noisy bedroom. Foam cuts wind, not fan. K8 DSP chip filters better than Rs 500 no-name mics.</p>
</div>

<div class="mt-4 text-sm bg-white border rounded-2xl p-4">
<h2 class="font-extrabold">FAQ</h2>
<p class="mt-1"><b>Realme/Xiaomi work?</b> Yes, enable OTG for wireless, use Open Camera for wired if native camera ignores mic.</p>
<p class="mt-1"><b>Wireless reliable under 2000?</b> K8 yes for Reels, Boya wired clearer for long YouTube.</p>
<p class="mt-3">Also try: <a href="/tools/budget-builder" class="text-indigo-700 font-bold">Budget builder →</a> | <a href="/tools/freelance-rate-calculator" class="text-indigo-700 font-bold">Rate calculator →</a></p>
</div>
<div class="text-xs text-gray-500 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-3 mt-4">Method: compared specs + 82k+ Amazon ratings + noisy-room use (fan/traffic). Prices change daily - check live price.</div>
</main>
</Layout>
